- 地圖圖資：© OpenStreetMap 貢獻者，採 ODbL；向量圖磚 © OpenFreeMap。封存的 CARTO 圖層若被選用會連線 basemaps.cartocdn.com，圖磚 © CARTO。使用時須保留署名。
- 使用者上傳之照片與文字：著作權屬各上傳者，並依站內投稿條款以公開方式分享。

This MIT license covers the project's *source code* only. The following have
their own sources and terms:

- Map data: © OpenStreetMap contributors, under ODbL; vector tiles © OpenFreeMap. Archived CARTO layers, if selected, connect to basemaps.cartocdn.com (tiles © CARTO). Attribution
  must be retained.
- User-uploaded photos and text: copyright remains with each uploader, shared
  publicly under the site's contribution terms.
- "100 Reasons to Pause" chair data is compiled from ArcGIS StoryMaps; confirm
  the original authors' permission and credit the source before public display.

