## 隨程式碼一起發佈 · Bundled with the source

### qrcode-generator  (assets/js/vendor/qrcode-generator.js)

用途：後台邀請 QR 與全螢幕分享 QR 的產生（本機託管，不依賴 CDN）。
Purpose: generating invite / share QR codes (self-hosted, no CDN dependency).

Copyright (c) 2009 Kazuhiko Arase — http://www.d-project.com/
Licensed under the MIT license: http://www.opensource.org/licenses/mit-license.php

(完整 MIT 條款如本檔頂部；原始檔頭亦保留其版權宣告。
 Full MIT text as at the top of this file; the source file retains its own header.)

